  "statuteText": "659:4 Hours of Polling in Municipalities. –\n\nAt all state elections in towns and cities the polls shall open not later than 11 o'clock in the morning and shall close not earlier than 7 o'clock in the evening. In cities, the city council shall determine the polling hours no later than 30 days prior to a state election."
